💻 $ lam -an --begin Map.empty \
    -e 'if field 5 =~ m/^\d{3}$/
        then Map.insertWith (+) (field 5) 1 acc else acc' \
    --end 'forEach (Map.toList acc) (\(s, n) -> putStrLn f"{s} {n}")' \
    --print-script=cli > status.lam

💻 $ lam status-min.lam --min 2 app.log
200 9
500 2
503 2

💻 $ lam status-min.lam --help
Usage: status-min.lam [OPTIONS] FILES...

  Count the status codes of the logs (none: the standard input)

Arguments:
  FILES...

Options:
  --min INT  [default: 1]
  --help     Show this message and exit
